"P3734009182" "{HeroName}, the Rularuu have struck a group of scouts who were moving to releive the men on Firebase November. The survivors say that some 5 men were captured by the Rularuu and taken prisoner. I can't imagine what those monsters will do to those men, and I don't want to have to explain it to their families. If you can <A HREF={ACCEPT}>rescue the captured scouts from the Rularuu</A>, before they come to harm, I would be very greatful."
// AcceptString :
"P23449511" "Rescue the captured scouts"
// SendOffString :
"P612047896" "The Rularuu are monsters, {HeroName}, that's one of the first things this place teaches you. It will be up to you to get those men out of there. I know you can do it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3840265772" "Rescue captured scouts"

