// IntroString :
"P450775177" "{HeroName}, there's been a serious incident. I've had a patrol go missing, and I beleive that the Rularuu are responsible. Those men may not have much time, {HeroName}, and they need your help. If you can't <A HREF={ACCEPT}>rescue the missing patrol</A>, I doubt they'll survive for long."
// SendOffString :
"P1229150009" "Thank you, {HeroName}, you may be the only chance those men have. Your sole objective will be to locate and liberate them from the Rularuu. I wish I had more information for you about what you'll be facing, but there's precious little to go on. I can suggest that you may wish to bring allies along, however. This could be very dangerous."

